  "residual_class_scope": "The new class completion retains the precision-one conjugacy class; it does not prescribe a chosen frame or assert uniqueness up to integral conjugacy.",
  "archive_layout": "The complete immediately previous release is retained. Older checked release ZIPs remain inside that archive; redundant direct copies are omitted from the new release. Original manuscript and outline archives remain directly available.",
