  "derived_realization_input_scope": "The declared classicality and attached-representation realization theorem, conjugacy-saturated Frobenius density, semisimplification existence preserving characteristic polynomials, and universal algebraic Brauer\u2013Nesbitt remain explicit supplied inputs. The Lean conclusions derive actual cohomology eigenvectors and actual representation isomorphisms from those inputs. No conclusion-specific intertwiner, companion, or classicality theorem is constructed or assumed as an unproved Lean axiom. No external standard fact is promoted into the internal-claim census.",
