  "five_gate_input_scope": "Residual occupancy and represented-deformation existence remain named external application inputs identifying the actual coefficient ring, universal representation, local quotients, and patched and Hecke carriers. The algebraic assembly does not assume arbitrary gate flags and does not prove representability. Applicable classicality and attached-representation realization, conjugacy-saturated Frobenius density, semisimplification existence preserving characteristic polynomials, and universal algebraic Brauer\u2013Nesbitt remain explicit supplied mathematical inputs. The resulting actual cohomology or tensor eigenvector and matrix representation isomorphism are derived. The compatible-system conclusion requires both existing common-spine families. The attached family, its distinguished member identity, common-spine evidence and semisimplifications are supplied existentially with the particular automorphic object produced by realization. No companion existence or external standard fact is promoted into the internal-claim census.",
  "five_gate_system_family_scope": "The pre-existing source family has distinguished member specialize rhoR x. Classicality supplies the occurring pi together with one attached family sigma, whose distinguished member is attached pi, whose Frobenius polynomials have the same common-field spine, and whose member semisimplifications exist. Memberwise intertwiners are derived for those two supplied families.",
  "independent_five_gate_review": "development/five_gate_independent_review.json",
